        <Param val="True" valType="bool" updates="None" name="syncScreenRefresh"/>
        <Param val="In this task, you will be shown two jars full of 100 colored beads similar to those above. One jar will contain 85% beads in one color (in this case yellow), and 15% beads in another color (in this case red). The other jar will contain colored beads in the opposite ratio.&amp;#10;For each trial, one of the jars will be randomly selected, but you will not be told which one. The computer will randomly draw beads from the selected jar. Your job is to decide which jar the beads are being drawn from. Click the left mouse button to draw another bead and the right mouse button to make a decision.&amp;#10;You can continue requesting up to a certain number of beads until you feel confident about making a decision. Jars will not swap mid-game.&amp;#10;Click on next to begin.&amp;#10;" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
